(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Syntactic Reduction in Idiomatic Coordinate Pairs:) Tj
T*
(   In fixed prepositional pairs and balanced coordinate binominals, articles are conventionally) Tj
T*
(   dropped to enhance rhythmic velocity:) Tj
T*
(   - "from top to bottom" \(Not *from the top to the bottom\).) Tj
T*
(   - "hand in hand".) Tj
T*
(   - "day by day".) Tj
T*
(   - "in vitro and in vivo".) Tj
T*
(   - "step by step".) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Telegraphic Ellipsis in Technical Tables and Flowcharts:) Tj
T*
(   In laboratory equipment flowcharts, table column headers, and benchside checklist protocols,) Tj
T*
(   articles are deliberately omitted for informational compression:) Tj
T*
(   - "Mix reagents. Spin tube. Discard supernatant. Dry pellet.") Tj
T*
(   - While appropriate for quick-reference SOP cards, full academic prose in research manuscripts) Tj
T*
(   requires restoring articles: "Mix the reagents. Spin the tube. Discard the supernatant, and dry) Tj
T*
(   the pellet.") Tj
T*
() Tj
